# Papyrus: Creation Kit wiki: Papyrus language reference (Bethesda); requirements/languages/papyrus.md
name     papyrus psc
keyword  Scriptname extends Function EndFunction Event EndEvent Property EndProperty Auto AutoReadOnly
keyword  If ElseIf Else EndIf While EndWhile Return State EndState Import Global Native Conditional
keyword  New As Self Parent Hidden
type     Int Float Bool String Actor ObjectReference Form Quest
builtin  True False None Debug
